\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
q_{j}=k_{j}^{f}\prod_{i=1}^{n_{s}}C_{i}^{\nu_{ij}^{f}}-k_{j}^{r}\prod_{i=1}^{n_{s}}C_{i}^{\nu_{ij}^{r}},\label{eq:chemical-reaction-rate-of-progress}
\end{equation}

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $k_{j}^{f}$
\end_inset

